Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:06.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.19,0:00:11.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,傳聞有一位女巫隱居在天窗市
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.13,0:00:19.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在萬聖節那天 去女巫的宅邸看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.51,0:00:50.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,女巫和她的伙伴們 會準備好甜蜜的糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,等候你的光臨！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:00:58.28,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.15,0:01:03.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,萬聖節快樂！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}大女巫由由與萬聖節派對！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:47.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都知道萬聖節是哪種節目嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:50.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是能夠得到糖果的節日！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是能夠穿有趣衣服的節日！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Trick or Treat！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.83,0:02:56.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這天要說“不給糖就搗蛋”！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.59,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是年長班的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:03.91,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要做萬聖節南瓜燈·傑克南瓜的面具！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:03.91,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1160,970)}{\fs50}Jack o'lantern
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要戴上這個去萬聖節狂歡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.57,0:03:13.91,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很期待萬聖節狂歡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舉市舉辦的狂歡節嘛 大家都興奮起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能去各家各戶討要糖果 小朋友們也樂在其中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:24.66,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們家也要準備好糖果了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.83,0:03:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:27.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,憐那有點害怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:30.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一點都不怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可要是被魔法變成南瓜頭...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:35.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？什麼？在聊什麼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,據說在分發糖果的人家裡...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會有真正的女巫！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.65,0:03:43.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的女巫？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在山丘上的那家...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:48.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住著一位老奶奶和小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有一個小寶寶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.99,0:03:52.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:54.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.74,0:03:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有一隻圓滾滾的小鳥！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:03:59.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 那不是我家嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:02.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小蝶老師的家嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.40,0:04:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那老師也是女巫的伙伴嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太帥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:08.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,等...等一下！為什麼由由阿姨會變成女巫？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:15.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為她會收集非常漂亮的藍色石頭...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會跟鏡子對話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.43,0:04:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能讓小寶寶漂浮起來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是真正的女巫吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:26.19,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 你也太光明正大了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:28.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:31.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孫女這麼說好像有點怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.37,0:04:33.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶還真的挺像女巫的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.03,0:04:36.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像小朋友們都很期待我的表現呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.37,0:04:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今年萬聖節必須要加把勁了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.95,0:04:45.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對了！為了讓房子看起來像真正的女巫宅邸 我們裝飾一下吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.65,0:04:46.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 贊成！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:49.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,過來的小朋友們肯定會喜歡的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.31,0:04:53.73,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,自然 由由阿姨要打扮成女巫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:58.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大名 大能耐傳奇·名譽大女巫·由由
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:58.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(790,970)}Hyper NengNai Legend
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲哎喲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:05.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空就是 大可愛肉嘟嘟小小女巫·天空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:06.74,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:09.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,打扮成怪物去討要糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:11.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊世界的節日真有趣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:12.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.89,0:05:14.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要怎麼樣參與呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.15,0:05:17.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,打扮成服侍女巫的南瓜怪 怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,幫忙分發糖果給小朋友們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:23.28,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這個主意好！太可愛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.62,0:05:26.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,南瓜怪 我能夠勝任嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.05,0:05:28.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,語氣要做點變化嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:31.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,普通的口吻 體現不出怪物的氣質呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.92,0:05:34.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,比如“給你糖果南瓜”？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:38.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 要做就要做到120分！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:39.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:39.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:41.59,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:43.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,唔唔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:44.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:51.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,糖果... 是不是... 只有小朋友才可以... 拿到的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.86,0:05:55.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我會準備好小晴和大伙的份的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:06:01.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我太期待萬聖節了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞 做完了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可太期待萬聖節了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼哼哼... 啊哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（隔壁那誰在敲牆）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:14.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}嚇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:29.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口傑口傑口傑口傑...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:54.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨女巫館...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:59.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大女巫在等著呢 請往裡走...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨女巫館
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:16.44,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不... 不給糖...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Trick or Treat！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.11,0:07:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不給糖就搗蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:40.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 很有精神！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:43.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你意下如何？大女巫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.45,0:07:46.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法道具要是被小搗蛋弄壞了 可就頭痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.20,0:07:48.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給他們糖果吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:50.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,來 給你！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:07:59.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不客氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.11,0:08:04.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不客氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女巫奶奶 能讓我看看魔法道具嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然可以 跟我來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:14.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在萬聖節分發糖果也很有趣呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:16.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:20.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得萬聖節是一個很特別的節日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:23.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能穿上平時不會穿的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.83,0:08:28.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,藉由一句"不給糖就搗蛋" 就能跟平時沒有交集的人 交流起來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:33.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,笑容也不斷地擴散開來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:37.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,萬聖節是不是就像是真正的魔法啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:42.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也這麼覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:47.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 等會去城裡逛逛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:49.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,唯美著迷也會分發糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:49.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(770,970)}Pretty Holic
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:50.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:50.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.15,0:08:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:58.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,（響指！）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.35,0:09:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變成Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忒喜歡糖果的搗蛋南瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南瓜頭愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Cure Pumpkin！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口傑口傑口傑口傑...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是唯美著迷咖啡店特製的南瓜頭餅乾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也給我一個！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 要遵守次序...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Trick and Treat！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既要搗蛋又要糖果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是Cure Pumpkin
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure的伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.55,0:10:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬聖節快樂！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:20.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}萬聖節狂歡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Pumpkin Cure Cure Pumpkin kin
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.43,0:10:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手！這是給大家準備的糖果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:39.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都不知道嗎？我是Cure Pumpkin
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.42,0:10:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure可最喜歡搗蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要打扮成Precure搗蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就會有大量的Precure粉 轉黑吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.95,0:10:54.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還能吃到糖果 萬聖節最棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.95,0:10:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開玩笑 你怎麼可能是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:10:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.69,0:11:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure會保護城市！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我見到過他們和怪物戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小朋友們說的對！你這個假貨！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什... 什麼意思？你們這些人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.37,0:11:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是正義的伙伴 Precure哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.93,0:11:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.31,0:11:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}環保袋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.26,0:11:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蜢 蜢 蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.66,0:11:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.69,0:11:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傻子才不跑 溜了溜了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:43.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？糖果全被搶走了 被Precure？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:45.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:56.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,假冒的Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.16,0:11:58.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,自稱是Cure Pumpkin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:01.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,在城裡到處搗蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.35,0:12:03.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,市民們沒有受傷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:04.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,還好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:08.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 糖果好像都被搶走了...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 我們剛準備去的呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:14.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.85,0:12:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女巫奶奶能用魔法做點什麼嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.74,0:12:35.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:37.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 施了真正的魔法？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:40.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,應該只是太期待萬聖節 買多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:45.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南瓜怪最喜歡人們的笑容了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.01,0:12:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以肯定能讓萬聖節重歸歡樂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:57.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們把糖果送給在城裡期待著的小朋友們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:12:58.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:02.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,既然假冒的Precure 用惡作劇奪走了人們的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:07.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就要把節日的氣氛轟到頂點 取回人們的笑容！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:09.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:12.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,糖果倍增 對吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:12.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(860,970)}Treat and Treat
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.42,0:13:13.61,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:17.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不能讓假冒的繼續妨礙節日了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.11,0:13:19.73,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Treat！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也去！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:23.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我們出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:26.16,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,出發！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:33.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好 我們來送糖果和笑容了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:34.48,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:38.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,來 給
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還以為拿不到糖果了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 南瓜怪大姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.85,0:13:46.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來這邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:50.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.50,0:13:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（快門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:55.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:13:57.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.84,0:13:58.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:01.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:11.99,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,糖果！給
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure一伙 搞什麼呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多少露出一點不甘的表情 來追假冒的Cure Pumpkin啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:28.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呸噠！不管你們發多少糖果 取悅那邊的傢伙們
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我Cure Pumpkin都要把這一切攪得天翻地覆！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸... 搞... 搞什麼啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！Cure Pumpkin就在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.91,0:14:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.27,0:14:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.81,0:14:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要生氣嘛 我有多的糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 給你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.93,0:15:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒有... 還沒完呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完蛋！是他...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:13.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:17.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召喚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:27.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.35,0:15:31.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.60,0:15:36.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,指示Cure Pumpkin這個假冒者在街上搗亂 也是你的計謀嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.15,0:15:39.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:42.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇兇兇兇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:44.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:50.83,CureSky,,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:50.83,CureSky,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:54.24,CureSky,,0,0,0,,天籟接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:54.24,CureSky,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:38.73,CurePri,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.53,0:16:00.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
