Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:55.25,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好硬...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:57.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:17:59.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇兇兇 兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.63,0:18:03.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.51,0:18:06.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇兇兇兇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:07.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好敏捷...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.97,0:18:10.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,攻擊不要停 嘗試抓它的破綻！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:13.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇兇兇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:16.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:17.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:18.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.99,0:18:25.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！你怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:27.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇兇兇兇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:28.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我還沒有說...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:30.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:34.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我還沒有說過“不給糖就搗蛋”呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:39.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是非常期待今天這一天的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:41.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:43.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:47.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有 我也想說啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.51,0:18:48.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:49.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky說的對！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.32,0:18:52.17,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:55.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴獸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.87,0:18:57.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:18:58.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:04.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:10.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,萬聖節是特別的魔法時間！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:14.35,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.79,0:19:18.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇兇兇！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.55,0:19:20.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:22.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:26.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不要來妨礙大伙的魔法！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:30.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:32.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是現在！
