Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然放出那種怪物搞破壞 已經不只是搗蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.03,0:21:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 那不是我放出來的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別找藉口！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:16.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不給糖就搗蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:16.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Trick or Treat！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 給
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:20.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.71,0:21:22.67,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我的是寶寶糖果？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對的 等變回去再吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:29.14,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好想吃大伙同款的糖果啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:31.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,用不了多久就能吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.56,0:21:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天窗市幼兒園
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶老師家的奶奶 是真正的女巫！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:42.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能用魔法變出很多的糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.69,0:21:46.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還跟Precure聊上了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.93,0:21:47.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.09,0:21:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure也是女巫的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.98,0:21:52.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:56.45,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這下明年萬聖節也得加油了 由由阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.03,0:21:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿嚏！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.86,0:22:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰在議論我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.41,0:22:03.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,吶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:09.18,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Butterfly喲！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:09.18,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,970)}蝴蝶愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.88,0:22:12.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 一起飛揚跳起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.28,0:23:48.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我和公主結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:49.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,要結婚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:51.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,有你的啊 少年！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.23,0:23:53.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,現在結婚 會不會還太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.32,0:23:54.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哇哇哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.32,0:23:57.29,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不不！一定要結婚！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.70,0:24:00.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.70,0:24:00.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.37,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要好♡ 小空結婚儀式☆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.31,0:01:07.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:13.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:18.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:26.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:31.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:35.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.74,0:01:37.24,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:41.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.14,0:01:46.14,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:48.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.23,0:01:52.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.07,0:01:56.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.65,0:02:00.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:02:00.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:02.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:02.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:07.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:12.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:17.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:22.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.89,0:02:25.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:33.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
